      ],
      "source": "https://www.loudounhistory.org/history/round-hill/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s name originates from a 1731 land grant by Thomas, sixth Lord Fairfax, to Benjamin Grayson, whose parcel lay west of Main Street.",
